WEBVTT

00:03:29.396 --> 00:03:33.516
And this is where
my obsession for beauty comes from,

00:03:33.556 --> 00:03:37.276
over the years,
trying to mimic it as a model,

00:03:37.316 --> 00:03:39.396
advocating for diversity in fashion,

00:03:39.436 --> 00:03:44.276
to launching "Ascension" magazine
to celebrate women of color,

00:03:44.316 --> 00:03:47.356
whose beauty is still underrepresented.

00:03:48.316 --> 00:03:52.996
With much pain and trauma behind one word,

00:03:53.036 --> 00:03:56.236
“pretty” taught me,
through my indigeneity,

00:03:56.236 --> 00:03:58.276
I could reclaim my beauty.

00:03:59.476 --> 00:04:01.196
To Indigenous women,